
File Name: role_helpers.dart

1. Modification Done:

   * Added officer roles: president, vice_president, secretary, treasurer.
   * Added isAnnouncementPublisher and canEditAnnouncement(authorId).

2. Purpose of This Modification:

   * Announcements v2 publishers are officers + admin/executive, not only generic executive role.
   * Creators edit own posts; admin can edit/delete any.

3. How This Modification Is Involved in the Flow:

   * Dashboard announcement create/edit/delete buttons and publisher-only UI in dashboard_member_screens.dart.
